  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ええっ！？　ほ、本当ですか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、本当だ！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そっか……\r\nえへへっ！　やった～！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、ちょっとスゴいアイドルになれたんですよねっ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。しっかりと一歩進んだんだ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんっ！\r\nあたし、ヒーローに近づけましたか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "『ジャスティスV』みたいに、\r\nみんなを笑顔にできるヒーローになれますかっ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんだ！　この調子で頑張れば、\r\n憧れのヒーローみたいになれるぞ",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしが、いつかヒーローに……っ！\r\nスゴいですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もしかしたら、そんなに遠くない日のことかもしれないな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "わぁ……！　\r\nあたし、その日が楽しみです！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん、しっかりと努力をしていけば、だけどな",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "なるほど……！\r\n努力を続けて勝利をつかみ取る、ですねっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだ\r\nだから気を抜かずに頑張っていこう！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　よーしっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、早速レッスン室へ行きましょう！\r\nヒーローになるためには、特訓あるのみですよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010100"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "たっくさんレッスンして、\r\n早くみんなを笑顔にするヒーローになりたいですっ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700900101/7009001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よしっ、その調子だ！　一緒に頑張ろうな！",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ！\r\nプロデューサーさんと一緒に、頑張りますっ！",
